use binding
register web-1.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use binding-app

grant
  grant call web-1.0::q to web

as web call web-1.0

as web call web-1.0 3 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

as web call web-1.0 1 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

as web assert Anonymous call web-1.0 2 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

revoke
  revoke call web-1.0::q from web

as web call web-1.0 2 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }

drop role web

as web call web-1.0 2 error Denied { detail: "role `web` may not make this call" }
